---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="DTP — LinkedIn Above Fold — AI Absorption"
  description="A DTP above-the-fold concept for advisory work around AI output absorption and operating control."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="social-fold absorption-fold">
    <section class="fold-hero">
      <div class="absorption-mesh" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="ma-container absorption-grid">
        <div class="absorption-copy">
          <span class="fold-kicker">// linkedin_card.seed_03 / advisory_control</span>
          <h1>AI did not remove the bottleneck. It moved it.</h1>
          <p>Teams can now generate drafts, summaries, recommendations and agents faster than the business can validate, own and absorb them. Advisory work starts where the bottleneck actually is.</p>
          <div class="fold-actions">
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a>
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-outline" href="/homepage-ai-readiness-command-centre/">See operating picture</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="bottleneck-card" aria-label="AI output absorption bottleneck illustration">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <span>absorption.capacity_check</span>
            <b>Production is no longer the hard part.</b>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-lanes">
            <div class="lane input">
              <small>Output</small>
              <div class="tokens"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottleneck">
              <span>review<br/>own<br/>integrate</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lane output">
              <small>Change</small>
              <div class="tokens output-tokens"><i></i><i></i></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="diagnostic-strip">
            <div><small>question 01</small><strong>Who validates it?</strong></div>
            <div><small>question 02</small><strong>Who owns it?</strong></div>
            <div><small>question 03</small><strong>What changes?</strong></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .social-fold { background: #050507; color: #EBEBEB; }
  .fold-hero { min-height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 8.75rem 0 4.75rem; display: grid; align-items: center; }
  .absorption-mesh { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 72% 40%, rgba(5,204,144,.09), transparent 62%), radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 20% 82%, rgba(255,185,45,.055), transparent 64%); pointer-events: none; }
  .absorption-grid { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4.6rem; align-items: center; }
  .fold-kicker { display: block; font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--ma-mint); margin-bottom: 1.7rem; }
  .absorption-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 6.75vw, 6.45rem); line-height: .91; letter-spacing: -.066em; max-width: 780px; }
  .absorption-copy p { max-width: 620px; margin: 1.55rem 0 2.25rem; font-size: 1.18rem; line-height: 1.72; color: rgba(235,235,235,.78); }
  .fold-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }

  .bottleneck-card { background: linear-gradient(150deg, #17172a 0%, #0f0f1d 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11); border-radius: 24px; padding: 1.45rem; box-shadow: 0 34px 110px rgba(0,0,0,.54), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(5,204,144,.05); }
  .bc-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.3rem; align-items: baseline; padding: .2rem .2rem 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07); }
  .bc-top span { font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); font-size: .72rem; color: var(--ma-mint); letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .bc-top b { font-family: var(--ma-font-display); color: rgba(235,235,235,.88); font-size: .92rem; text-align: right; max-width: 215px; }
  .flow-lanes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 112px 1fr; gap: 1.1rem; align-items: center; min-height: 340px; margin: 1.3rem 0; }
  .lane { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1rem; min-height: 245px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .lane small { font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); color: rgba(235,235,235,.72); font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .tokens { display: grid; gap: .62rem; }
  .tokens i { display: block; height: 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(5,204,144,.8), rgba(5,204,144,.16)); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(5,204,144,.1); }
  .tokens i:nth-child(2) { width: 86%; } .tokens i:nth-child(3) { width: 72%; } .tokens i:nth-child(4) { width: 94%; } .tokens i:nth-child(5) { width: 78%; } .tokens i:nth-child(6) { width: 66%; }
  .output-tokens i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(235,235,235,.46), rgba(235,235,235,.12)); }
  .bottleneck { min-height: 275px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,185,45,.28); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,185,45,.12), rgba(5,204,144,.05)); display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
  .bottleneck span { font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); font-size: .74rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(255,210,120,.95); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; text-align: center; }
  .diagnostic-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07); background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); }
  .diagnostic-strip div { background: #10101d; padding: 1rem; min-height: 110px; }
  .diagnostic-strip small { display: block; font-family: var(--ma-font-mono); color: var(--ma-mint); font-size: .65rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
  .diagnostic-strip strong { font-family: var(--ma-font-display); color: var(--ma-white); font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.15; }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .absorption-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .fold-hero { padding-top: 9rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .flow-lanes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .bottleneck { min-height: 110px; border-radius: 20px; } .diagnostic-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .absorption-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 14vw, 4.7rem); } }
</style>
